<title>POLAND: OCEAN NOV NET FALLS TO PLN 0.1 MLN.</title>
<headline>OCEAN NOV NET FALLS TO PLN 0.1 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results November</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.12 vs   0.33</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 0.19 vs   0.56</p>
<p> Operating profit     0.10 vs   0.46</p>
<p> Sales		    3.10 vs   2.76</p>
<p>JANUARY-NOVEMBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.34 vs   1.02</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 2.30 vs   1.73</p>
<p> Operating profit     2.23 vs   1.59</p>
<p> Sales		   31.70 vs  25.07</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish wholesaler is Ocean Company SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
